[0.007, "o", "\u001b[20B\u001b[27m============================================================\r\n Demo 2: canary and blue-green release flows\r\n \b\n What you're about to see: knative-ctl driving two release\r\n strategies against the 'knative-demo-app' Knative Service, both built\r\n \u001b["]
[0.005, "o", "H\u001b[25B directly on spec.traffic revision splitting -- no Argo\r\n Rollouts, no Flagger, no service mesh. First a progressive\r\n canary (10% -> 50% -> 100%), then a blue-green dark-deploy and\r\n atomic cutover. Watch the k9s pane above for the new revision's\r\n pod appearing before traffic ever reaches it.\r\n============================================================\r\n \u001b[H"]
